00:27:28.750 --> 00:27:33.230
I crawled underneath the fence after classes ended... {fi, link}

00:27:28.750 --> 00:27:33.230
{}Houkago no guraundo no waki{}

00:27:33.230 --> 00:27:36.770
...and made my way to the far side of the schoolyard. {link, fo}

00:27:33.230 --> 00:27:36.770
{}Kanaami wo kugutte{}

00:27:37.690 --> 00:27:42.170
The sunflower we found last year was... {fi link}

00:27:37.690 --> 00:27:42.170
