00:27:55.280 --> 00:27:59.280
If you put that meaning in your tears... {link fo}

00:27:55.280 --> 00:27:59.280
{}Namida ni dekitanara{}

00:27:59.740 --> 00:28:05.750
...then maybe something will change tomorrow. {fi fo}

