00:28:08.680 --> 00:28:13.160
On rainy days, I get swayed by the droplets. {fi link}

00:28:08.680 --> 00:28:13.160
{}Ame furu hi wa, {}ame ni yureru{}

00:28:13.160 --> 00:28:17.430
I wish I could be like that sunflower... {link fo}

00:28:13.160 --> 00:28:17.430
{}Ano himawari mitai ni{}

00:28:17.590 --> 00:28:21.640
...and stand up straight and tall. {fi fo}

00:28:17.590 --> 00:28:21.640
{}Massugu se wo nobashite{}

00:28:22.050 --> 00:28:28.570
Even if I'm trembling today... it's all right. {fi fo}

